                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This report analyzes student outcomes and learning engagement across 22 course presentations in the Open University Learning Analytics Dataset (OULAD), covering 28,785 students and 32,593 registrations.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The underlying data was migrated from a legacy SQL Server warehouse into a Microsoft Fabric Lakehouse using a Bronze/Silver/Gold medallion architecture, then modeled into a star schema for analysis.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Technical Roadmap:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Object-level security on imd_band  identified as the sensitive column worth restricting; requires Tabular Editor over the XMLA endpoint, since Fabric's web-based semantic model editor doesn't expose OLS natively. Evaluated deliberately, same as the SCD2 decision below not overlooked.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "SCD2 history tracking evaluated for dim_student, but this source records attributes per-registration with no real temporal change to version; the right design for a future source that actually has one.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Formal statistical validation of the engagement-outcome relationship the current report shows engagement varies sharply by module; a proper correlation test (clicks vs. withdrawal/pass outcome, controlling for module) would confirm whether this is a real predictive signal or a module-level confound.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
